                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f99ead9b-3766-3877-bc4e-e43e64732320",
                        "entry_id": "2d64a335-8dde-319e-9392-c89f2b8b0568",
                        "glosses": [
                            "заклинание"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "894b1a6e-d686-49b6-a558-e6bcad4ef116",
                                "sense_id": "f99ead9b-3766-3877-bc4e-e43e64732320",
                                "text": "— Как же это вдруг ни с того ни с сего пропал человек, ровно клад от аминя рассыпался?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "64af4ee3-f6e0-3c04-9d7f-10f19a692228",
                        "entry_id": "2d64a335-8dde-319e-9392-c89f2b8b0568",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. конец, всё кончено"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e0ce6ab-932a-46f2-8089-4823ccaa87b9",
                                "sense_id": "64af4ee3-f6e0-3c04-9d7f-10f19a692228",
                                "text": "Я так понимаю, ежели который человек нажил капитал, тому самое лучшее дело — купить револьвер, выпалить и аминь…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "74462fd8-4543-3c19-8996-8ac17e4cff03",
                "word": "аминь",
                "pos": "particle",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "183a9283-fa72-3552-95d1-d1a4a3d2f24d",
                        "entry_id": "74462fd8-4543-3c19-8996-8ac17e4cff03",
                        "glosses": [
                            "религ. заключительное слово христианских молитв и проповедей; истинно, верно, да будет так"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "утвердительная частица"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6719a3f0-5019-4ac5-ba13-1f9516bd02c2",
                                "sense_id": "183a9283-fa72-3552-95d1-d1a4a3d2f24d",
                                "text": "Подумаем над этим, и если мы не способны сделать ничего, то хоть поймём, кто мы, где мы, и обернёмся ко Христу хоть в последний час с возгласом, с молитвой разбойника: Помяни мя, Господи, во Царствии Твоём! Аминь."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5a19b0d2-e239-3f09-b53c-99e879fcc418",
                        "entry_id": "74462fd8-4543-3c19-8996-8ac17e4cff03",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. всё, всё кончено, конец"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "предикатив"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ef60b914-d437-33fa-9e0a-485bfc9db287",
                        "entry_id": "74462fd8-4543-3c19-8996-8ac17e4cff03",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. употребляется как магическое заклинание спасти от нечистой силы"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "межд."
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ad96c58-07e7-4e25-9157-b4ceaabd1fe8",
                                "sense_id": "ef60b914-d437-33fa-9e0a-485bfc9db287",
                                "text": "А как обернётся клад в животное, тотчас хлопни его левой рукой со словами «аминь, аминь, рассыпься»."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e44066d4-01f6-4d59-b207-6c913a761665",
                        "source_entry_id": "74462fd8-4543-3c19-8996-8ac17e4cff03",
                        "target_lang_word": "amen",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "amen",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5e8cf39-3fdd-3025-b3a6-606434950af2",
                                        "entry_id": "50e5b3cd-a156-3441-9365-6220b7380128",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "At the end of religious prayers: so be it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cd0ac72-9a1e-4f57-9f2d-a74016b01ac8",
                                                "sense_id": "b5e8cf39-3fdd-3025-b3a6-606434950af2",
                                                "text": "As it was in the beginning, is nowe, and euerſhall be: worlde without ende. Amen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5ace2e0-d146-4f6a-a92f-13c8074f0f26",
                                                "sense_id": "b5e8cf39-3fdd-3025-b3a6-606434950af2",
                                                "text": "Alſo I ſhooke my lap, and ſaid, So God ſhake out euery man from his houſe, and from his labour, that performeth not this promiſe, euen thus be he ſhaken out, and emptied. And all the Congregation ſaid, Amen, and praiſed the Lord. And the people did according to this promiſe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2eec2ce6-b5dc-4d65-89ca-9a60949407d7",
                                                "sense_id": "b5e8cf39-3fdd-3025-b3a6-606434950af2",
                                                "text": "Bleſſed be the Lord God, the God of Iſrael, who only doth wonderous things. And bleſſed be his glorious name for euer, and let the whole earth be filled with his glory. Amen, and Amen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88b7df1a-3324-4a97-be98-11ea39f948fa",
                                                "sense_id": "b5e8cf39-3fdd-3025-b3a6-606434950af2",
                                                "text": "For thine is the kingdom, the power, and the glory, for ever and ever. Amen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb117fea-6fac-40d0-a0dd-13a9a178359b",
                                                "sense_id": "b5e8cf39-3fdd-3025-b3a6-606434950af2",
                                                "text": "May GOD, to Whom be praise and whose name be exalted, the King of Kings, vouchsafe His grace and may the Prophet Muhammed (on whom be the benediction and peace of GOD) grant His Blessings to this Proclamation. Amen! O Lord of the Universe!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b628139-a1fc-3541-a31d-0b593227c1d2",
                                        "entry_id": "50e5b3cd-a156-3441-9365-6220b7380128",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used to indicate emphatic agreement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b94b1bf-cb0d-458c-aa58-16d630fc8df9",
                                                "sense_id": "6b628139-a1fc-3541-a31d-0b593227c1d2",
                                                "text": "Fry: Bender's stupid religion is driving me nuts! / Leela: Amen!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "amen",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ed28a39-faa3-392e-98d1-40c041b46157",
                                        "entry_id": "a0fab22f-5066-31d9-bb3e-0a3c6997ed88",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Certainly; verily."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c59e100c-0ced-4873-b767-dc50208367dc",
                                                "sense_id": "9ed28a39-faa3-392e-98d1-40c041b46157",
                                                "text": "Iesvs anſvvered, Amen, Amen I ſay to thee, Vnles a man be borne againe of vvater and the Spirit, he can not enter into the kingdom of God."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "amen",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4116edcb-5bca-3a69-a6f6-57e6555bc917",
                                        "entry_id": "85f74eed-e655-3caf-889c-98f4925062d0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of saying ‘amen’."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25978212-1027-49de-b3c8-fb6fa4f9be3a",
                                                "sense_id": "4116edcb-5bca-3a69-a6f6-57e6555bc917",
                                                "text": "The amens of the dusty clerk appear, like Macbeth’s, to stick in his throat a little; but Captain Cuttle helps him out, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e5aa249-6f00-4a96-8473-969164fe6442",
                                                "sense_id": "4116edcb-5bca-3a69-a6f6-57e6555bc917",
                                                "text": "[H]is `Amens' were ejected at the pulpit with the severity of a reprimand."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3425bb00-7a3a-4ccd-9897-677d630a4c33",
                                                "sense_id": "4116edcb-5bca-3a69-a6f6-57e6555bc917",
                                                "text": "A chorus of amens rang out across the audience."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "amen",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c6ed57c-b437-3b69-8350-e048b0bb0a8a",
                                        "entry_id": "bbccea39-d146-380c-bb7a-2e16acb65b46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To say amen."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdba0ce7-36b4-4458-86df-14b4de17bef0",
                                                "sense_id": "4c6ed57c-b437-3b69-8350-e048b0bb0a8a",
                                                "text": "The moment Dr. Reid amened, we rushed straight out of the church off home."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c97ad1af-d4d7-4334-9816-85d55bfccee2",
                                                "sense_id": "4c6ed57c-b437-3b69-8350-e048b0bb0a8a",
                                                "text": "Most of the church amened and applauded."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5034913-43e1-4615-9950-508465a66d0f",
                                                "sense_id": "4c6ed57c-b437-3b69-8350-e048b0bb0a8a",
                                                "text": "She must be thinking Reverend Hopkins is talking directly to her, because she starts amening and shouting real loud when he gets to the part in Proverbs […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2740069e-2da1-35e5-96c1-29dacebddfa2",
                                        "entry_id": "bbccea39-d146-380c-bb7a-2e16acb65b46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To say amen to; to ratify solemnly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdf3b11f-3120-450f-8f65-c9218f795a4c",
                                                "sense_id": "2740069e-2da1-35e5-96c1-29dacebddfa2",
                                                "text": "spending the first half of the rally amening any mention of God or Reagan"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4a177bd2-1494-4f86-94e2-c2b2b8740206",
                        "source_entry_id": "74462fd8-4543-3c19-8996-8ac17e4cff03",
                        "target_lang_word": "amén",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "amén",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5c610a9-5f20-3c0a-b93b-0a697bb986a2",
                                        "entry_id": "d2f5b8cd-d50b-3e5f-bc56-aa799a5f029e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Úsase para manifestar deseo de que algo suceda."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "noun"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2041114-fc0c-48e1-8df6-a27cf39274ae",
                                                "sense_id": "b5c610a9-5f20-3c0a-b93b-0a697bb986a2",
                                                "text": "Mas Tú nos libra de mal,\namén."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62e932bd-afce-47e7-a4ee-0244761d0b13",
                                                "sense_id": "b5c610a9-5f20-3c0a-b93b-0a697bb986a2",
                                                "text": "Esto dirá Simón, y yo en la misa de mañana diré lo mismo a Dios y a la Virgen para que se enteren de lo que aquí está pasando... Isabel, ponte en guardia, que si tus amenes llegan al Cielo, los míos también."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5c20a4d-140e-34b6-80d8-ccc31c57c9ff",
                                        "entry_id": "d2f5b8cd-d50b-3e5f-bc56-aa799a5f029e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Úsase para manifestar aprobación o conformidad con lo dicho por otro."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "noun"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e9a4560-15cd-4f4a-aa54-ffd99c6fc5b1",
                                                "sense_id": "b5c20a4d-140e-34b6-80d8-ccc31c57c9ff",
                                                "text": "el conyugal recato\nEs meritorio; mas segun en quiénes.\nLo aplaudo en las hermosas que al conato\nDe ninfo audaz responden con desdenes;\nNo en la fea sin sal ni garabato,\nQue tal vez fuera pródiga de amenes\nSi valiese la pena de que un cuco\nSe atreviese á decirle: ‘Envido y truco’."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b316800d-9c8b-4737-ae36-c6811b596a14",
                                                "sense_id": "b5c20a4d-140e-34b6-80d8-ccc31c57c9ff",
                                                "text": "En conjunto, mi juicio se resume en una palabra: amén. Me siento absolutamente compenetrado con tus puntos de vista."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "amén",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ce81f888-b0bb-3411-aa87-9aaaeeba4809",
                                        "entry_id": "7ed99bbd-eeaa-3751-aee6-f0f8496ccbc0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Extremo posterior de algo, en sentido temporal o espacial."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23acbcc8-5fcc-41ef-9a99-7b5f9265960a",
                                                "sense_id": "ce81f888-b0bb-3411-aa87-9aaaeeba4809",
                                                "text": "Los héroes marciales de la revolución española no mudaron de grito hasta los últimos amenes."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "amén",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d969984a-4486-307c-a26d-eb6b642f68d6",
                                        "entry_id": "62f4863d-d8e6-38ab-ab96-90110d229ee8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Añadido a lo precedente."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "se usa solamente en amén de"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b922d6a-c8be-45a0-9ab0-9efda72a0be8",
                                                "sense_id": "d969984a-4486-307c-a26d-eb6b642f68d6",
                                                "text": "Esquivé, otro sí, el pleonasmo del no aprobado, por no reincidir en el ridículo paso del célebre academista Bárgas-Ponce; el cual, imprimiendo una memoria que escribió para la concurrencia a los premios académicos de 1791, la anunció con la nota de presentada y nó premiada: con que manifestó, amén de su poquedad, su pueril resentimento."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf4466a4-7064-4b94-bc64-2df46ca78bc9",
                                                "sense_id": "d969984a-4486-307c-a26d-eb6b642f68d6",
                                                "text": "La habitación alta está dividida en sendos compartimentos, adornados cada uno con su tablado de cama verde, jergón de paja, sábanas choriceras y manta segoviana; su mesilla de pino, con un jarro candil y una estampa del Dos de Mayo o del Juicio final, pegada con miga de pan en el comedio de la pared; amén de los diversos adornos que alternativamente aparecen y desaparecen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "80a5766c-8b24-4e15-8bc7-63d238cd4d15",
                        "source_entry_id": "74462fd8-4543-3c19-8996-8ac17e4cff03",
                        "target_lang_word": "amen",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "amen",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31f835e8-daa2-35ba-97c6-f93f6e72a119",
                                        "entry_id": "0c5ebff1-983d-3613-9460-528e830acb9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Akklamationsformel im jüdischen, christlichen und islamischen Gottesdienst, die als Bekräftigung am Ende eines Gebets, Segens, einer Schriftlesung oder Predigt dient"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91e09f80-0a1f-4dd7-8e51-9ad1cf5c29bc",
                                                "sense_id": "31f835e8-daa2-35ba-97c6-f93f6e72a119",
                                                "text": "„Und Sara sagte zusammen mit ihm: Amen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e37ce1d4-e280-4f8c-bfaf-acbd13aa3da1",
                                                "sense_id": "31f835e8-daa2-35ba-97c6-f93f6e72a119",
                                                "text": "„Gott möge dir ewigen Ruhm schenken und dich reich mit seinem Segen belohnen. Denn in der Not unseres Volkes hast du dein Leben nicht geschont; nein, du hast entschlossen unseren Untergang von uns abgewehrt, du bist vor unserem Gott auf geradem Weg gegangen. Und alles Volk rief: Amen, amen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6ea48b3-5675-4f66-af3b-8e8223f1e10a",
                                                "sense_id": "31f835e8-daa2-35ba-97c6-f93f6e72a119",
                                                "text": "„Gepriesen sei der Herr in Ewigkeit. Amen, ja amen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "953bd231-5e5f-42ff-83cc-54f99eb14684",
                                                "sense_id": "31f835e8-daa2-35ba-97c6-f93f6e72a119",
                                                "text": "„Amen, das sage ich euch: Unter allen Menschen hat es keinen größeren gegeben als Johannes den Täufer; doch der Kleinste im Himmelreich ist größer als er.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1749a480-3677-4123-b3b6-9c62692e7e11",
                                                "sense_id": "31f835e8-daa2-35ba-97c6-f93f6e72a119",
                                                "text": "„Und wenn er es findet – amen, ich sage euch: er freut sich über dieses eine mehr als über die neunundneunzig, die sich nicht verirrt haben.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f7a2248-66f9-4f79-bac5-deee7f6a8707",
                                                "sense_id": "31f835e8-daa2-35ba-97c6-f93f6e72a119",
                                                "text": "„Amen, das sage ich euch: Wer das Reich Gottes nicht so annimmt wie ein Kind, der wird nicht hineinkommen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e7b8533-e278-45ae-9562-689a9caaa91a",
                                                "sense_id": "31f835e8-daa2-35ba-97c6-f93f6e72a119",
                                                "text": "„Jesus antwortete ihm: Amen, amen, ich sage dir: Wenn jemand nicht von neuem geboren wird, kann er das Reich Gottes nicht sehen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9292beb0-a2a9-4014-9876-76b0e9fc04e3",
                                                "sense_id": "31f835e8-daa2-35ba-97c6-f93f6e72a119",
                                                "text": "„Ihm sei Ehre in alle Ewigkeit. Amen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03548253-b067-4386-8176-b43d510ac930",
                                                "sense_id": "31f835e8-daa2-35ba-97c6-f93f6e72a119",
                                                "text": "„Er, der dies bezeugt, spricht: Ja, ich komme bald. - Amen. Komm, Herr Jesus!“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
